===Etymology===
Brand name; according to {{w|Segway Inc.}}, chosen for similarity to {{m|en|segue}} on notion of “a smooth transition from one place to another”, with probable influence of {{m|en|way}}.<ref>{{R:Online Etymology Dictionary|v=25975}}</ref>

